  message: "Fixed in PR #3809. Docstring rewritten to honestly enumerate the field's actual producers (10 niche-language analyzers + 2 linkers + external-boundary synthesis) and clarify that mainstream-analyzer languages leave canonical_name=None by design because name already encodes the parent. Added paragraph to containment-linker module docstring noting Phase 1.5 is reachable only for niche analyzers. Audit-then-rewrite per the playbook."  # 641c
